      "title": "Connections to Quantum Mechanics",
      "pages": [12],
      "text": "The document explores a surprising connection between the zeta function and quantum mechanics. The spacing between zeros of the zeta function mirrors the energy levels of heavy atomic nuclei, suggesting a potential link between number theory and quantum physics."
    },
