      "title": "Open Questions about Primes",
      "pages": [13],
      "text": "The document highlights several unsolved problems related to prime numbers, including the twin prime conjecture and Goldbach's conjecture. These questions have resisted solutions for decades, demonstrating the ongoing mysteries surrounding prime numbers."
